  "A complete, teacher-led paper game from Paper Adventure for ages 6–12. Crews share clues, make a display badge and review another crew’s work.": "Paper Adventure 的一款完整课堂纸上游戏，适合6至12岁儿童。学生分组分享线索、制作桌面徽章，并互相核查作品。",
  "The invitation is scattered. Your crews bring the welcome together.": "邀请函散落了，小队一起迎接新伙伴。",
  "A gust has scattered the Adventure Club invitation before its first welcome ceremony. Your students become a crew who rebuilds the message, prepares the welcome table and makes the Club’s first paper display badge together.": "第一次欢迎仪式前，一阵风吹散了冒险俱乐部的邀请函。学生要拼好消息、摆好欢迎桌，再制作俱乐部的第一枚桌面纸徽章。",
  "A gust has scattered the Adventure Club invitation before its first welcome ceremony. Pupils rebuild the message, prepare the table and make the Club’s first paper display badge.": "第一次欢迎仪式前，一阵风吹散了冒险俱乐部的邀请函。学生要拼好消息、摆好欢迎桌，再制作俱乐部的第一枚桌面纸徽章。",
  "The teacher reads each scene and releases the next mission’s materials after a checked result. Crews share information, agree on a design and finish by reviewing another crew’s work.": "老师朗读每段故事，核对结果后再发下一关材料。小队分享信息、共同确定设计，最后互相核查作品。",
  "For 2–35 pupils in crews of 2–6. Each crew uses one complete paper set and makes one shared desk badge.": "适合2至35名学生，每组2至6人。每组使用一整套材料，共同制作一枚桌面展示徽章。",
  "An adult reads the scenes and releases one numbered pile at a time. Children share the Courier, Spotter, Mapper and Keeper jobs, then rotate after checkpoints 1–4. Everyone helps explain the team’s choices.": "成人朗读故事，每次只发一组关卡材料。孩子分担信使、观察员、绘图员与保管员的工作，第1至4关后轮换，每人都要解释一次小队的选择。",
  "Print one complete Player Pack per team.": "每队打印一套完整的玩家材料。",
  "The adult host is additional to the children.": "成人主持人不计入儿童玩家人数。",
  "Player Pack + Adult Guide · no account or payment": "玩家材料 +",
