  "The PDF edition is being updated. Please try again later.": "中文版资料版本正在更新，未下载文件。请稍后重新检查。",
  "The badge can stay flat or fold into a table tent. It is a desk display; no pin or glue is needed.": "本版徽章平放在桌面展示，不折叠、不佩戴，无需别针或胶水。",
  "The team draws or writes its checked design on the badge. Keep it flat or fold it into a standing table tent.": "小组先按原线索核对，再在展示卡上画或写最终设计。本版平放展示。",
  "Four actual rotating team jobs and the five-mission crew record": "真实的四张角色卡与五关进度清单",
  "The crew’s blueprint records what belongs where and which clue supports each choice.": "小组在计划图的相应位置画或写，并能指回支持它的原线索。",
  "Jobs rotate after each mission. Two or three pupils may combine jobs; with five or six, partners share Reading or Moving and each speaks or moves before rotating. The four badge clues are information to share, separate from these job titles.": "按教师指南的2至6人逐关分工表轮换。兼任依次完成两个任务，搭档交换先做与核查。角色更换时，已经解出的证据留在本组。",
  "Pass the badge and all four clue cards to the next crew in a circle. Reviewers compare each feature with its clue and return any mismatch for a friendly repair.": "老师统一启动互查；徽章、四张原线索及互查表成套传出。核查后由原组修正，再复查、归还。"
